@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Hiragino Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ranksep 15
skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ArrowColor #506776
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #486477
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F0F6F8
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #F5F2E9
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E9
skinparam dpi 170
rectangle "モデルから定める\n型付き契約" as contract
rectangle "既存の部品\n公開Service / Operation" as existing
rectangle "業務固有の補完\n計算・外部接続" as extension
rectangle "アプリケーションの構成\n契約に沿って部品を接続" as app
rectangle "Textus / CNCF\n認可・確定・終了管理・観測" as runtime
contract -left-> existing : 選択条件
contract -right-> extension : 実装条件
existing -down-> app : 再利用
extension -down-> app : 不足部分を補う
app -down-> runtime : 共通経路を使う
note bottom of runtime
業務機能と実行管理の両方を再利用する
end note

@enduml
